tons" target="_blank">visit the Link and Button tools\' User Guide article.</a> Happy course building!',titleV2:"Link V2",btn_titleV2:"Button V2",linkType:"Link Type",urlTypeSecure:"Secure (https://)",urlTypeNormal:"Normal (http://)",urlTypeEmail:"Email (mailto:)",urlTypeElementId:"Element ID (#)",urlPlaceholder:"Paste or type a URL",elementIdPlaceholder:"section-heading (no # needed)",invalidEmail:'<p class="my-0">Enter a valid email address.</p>',newTabForced:"Canvas always opens links outside your institution in a new tab.",advancedOptions:"Advanced Options",advancedIntro:"These override Canvas defaults for this link only. Each one is described below — use them when you have a specific reason.",advancedNone:"No advanced options apply to this link.",removeUnderlineHint:"Underlines are how many students spot a link in body text.",externalHint:"The icon is the only cue that the link leaves Canvas.",youtubeHint:"The video no longer embeds — students get a text link instead.",importPageShort:"Replace link with imported course content",importPageHint:"Put the link in its own paragraph — the page’s content replaces that whole paragraph. Public viewers and the Canvas mobile app still see just the link.",importPageDatedHint:"Outside these dates the link disappears entirely rather than showing as a link.",dateFrom:"From",dateTo:"To",fileOptionsHint:"Whether the file opens on its own page, previews right here, or downloads.",fileOptionsValue:"File Options: {option}",buttonOptions:"Button Options",hoverFocusOptions:"Hover/Focus Options",visitedOptions:"Visited Options",solidButton:"Solid Button",outlineButton:"Outline Button",hoverBg:"Hover BG",hoverText:"Hover Text",visitedBg:"Visited BG",visitedText:"Visited Text",sizeValue:"Size: {size}",size_default:"Default",size_box:"Box",favoritesApplyHint:"Select a favorite to apply it.",favoritesManageHint:"Rename or remove saved styles.",manageFavorites:"Manage",doneManaging:"Done",favoriteStyleName:"Style {n}",favoriteNameLabel:"N