ugs or other problems with DesignPLUS"],links:[{text:"Cidi Labs Support Home",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.com/support/"}]},code:{descriptions:["Add preformatted code elements","Display code snippets as examples or instructional content"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Code",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/code"}]},columnV2:{descriptions:["Create responsive column layouts","Utilize horizontal space on the page","Present content side-by-side to students","Design with a grid layout"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Columns",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/columns"}]},contentBlock:{descriptions:["Group page elements into sections of content","Quickly create page layout from block templates","Organize pages into manageable pieces to increase usability for students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Content Blocks",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/content-blocks"}]},contrastChecker:{descriptions:["Review and fix any color contrast issues present on the page","Ensure that text is accessible and readable for students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Contrast Checker",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/contrast-checker"}]},contrastChecker2:{descriptions:["Review and fix any color contrast issues present on the page","Ensure that text is accessible and readable for students","The fail section shows colors that fall below the WCAG contrast requirements","The guidance section shows colors that only fail in dark mode or in accessibility scanners","The pass section shows colors that meet or exceed the WCAG contrast requirements"]},courseHelpListHeading:{descriptions:["Find help for the course sidebar tools"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Course Sidebar Help",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/course-sidebar"}],page:!0},courseListHeading:{descriptions:["Access tools that can make course-level changes"],links:[{text