d"),intro:z("walkthrough_intro_text_detail","In the <strong>Text</strong> panel, <ul><li>the <strong>text align</strong> controls adjust the text alignment of the selected element,</li><li>the <strong>text style</strong> controls apply bold, italic, or underlined styling to text,</li><li>and the <strong>text color</strong> controls apply one of your institution's branding colors to the text of the selected element. (For a wider array of colors, you'll need to use the <strong>Colors</strong> panel, which will be covered in a couple of steps.)</li></ul>"),element:document.querySelector(".sidebar-body"),preChange:function(){u()()("h5#dpPanelBorderBg").hasClass("active")&&document.querySelector('a[href="#dpPanelBorderBg"]').click(),u()()("h5#dpPanelText").hasClass("active")||document.querySelector('a[href="#dpPanelText"]').click(),this.element=document.querySelector("#dpPanelTextContent")}},{title:z("walkthrough_title_border_bg","Style the Selected Element: Border & Background"),intro:z("walkthrough_intro_border_bg","In the <strong>Border & Background</strong> panel, you can update the border attributes and basic background attributes of the selected element."),element:document.querySelector(".sidebar-body"),preChange:function(){u()()("h5#dpPanelText").hasClass("active")&&document.querySelector('a[href="#dpPanelText"]').click(),u()()("h5#dpPanelBorderBg").hasClass("active")||document.querySelector('a[href="#dpPanelBorderBg"]').click(),this.element=document.querySelector("#dpPanelBorderBg")}},{title:z("walkthrough_title_border_bg_detail","Style the Selected Element: Border & Background Continued"),intro:z("walkthrough_intro_border_bg_detail","<ul><li>The <strong>border direction</strong> controls set the border direction of the selected element,</li><li>the <strong>border radius</strong> controls set the element's border radius (in pixels),</li><li>the <strong>background color</strong> button shows options to set one of your institution's branding colors as the backgroun